{"title":"Toronto Coronation Street Meet Up","startsAt":"2026-10-22T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-22T19:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Do you watch Coronation street but have no one to talk to about the comings and goings of this classic UK show? Then come and have a natter over a pint or a cuppa with a group of CS fans!\n\nA positive, laid back group with the emphasis on fun. If you do not enjoy currently watching the show, this is not the meet up for you. No haters or grumps!!! 😃 Although we can all agree that we are glad someone finally bumped off Theo! 🤣\n\nThere might even be trivia…and perhaps prizes. All suggestions for time of day and venue preferences welcome. Please read group description to see if this is the group for you.","venue":{"name":"Elephant & Castle","address":"212 King St W, Toronto, ON M5H 1K5, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.647632,"lng":-79.386438,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Coronation Street Lovers!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/5/d/9/highres_536301977.jpeg"}